{"files":[{"content":"#include <iostream>\n#include <string>\n#include <map>\n#include <list>\n#include <queue>\n#include <climits>\n\nusing namespace std;\n\nint nCores = 0;\nint nVertices = 0;\nint nArestas = 0;\nint no_of_vert = 0;\nint contCor = 0;\nint compact_color_count = 0;\n\nvector<int> caminhoTropical;\nvector<int> caminho;\nvector<int> vertex_color_ids;\nvector<pair<int, int>> arvoreGeradora;\n\nstruct part\n{\n    vector<pair<int, int>> spanning;\n    vector<pair<int, int>> inc_ed;\n    vector<pair<int, int>> exc_ed;\n};\n\nvector<part> partitions;\nvector<pair<int, int>> current_span;\n\nclass graph{\n\tpublic:\n\t    int Vertex;\n\t    vector<vector<int>> adj_mat;\n\t    vector<int> cores;\n\t    \n\t    graph(int vertex)\n\t    {\n\t    \tVertex = vertex;\n\t        for(int i = 0; i < Vertex; i++){\n\t        \tvector<int> aux;\n\t            for(int j = 0; j < Vertex; j++){\n\t                aux.push_back(0);\n\t\t\t\t}\n\t\t\t\tadj_mat.push_back(aux);\n            }\n                \n\t        for(int i = 0; i < Vertex; i++)\n\t           cores.push_back(0);\n\t    }\n\t    \n\t    void add_edge(int u, int v)\n\t    {\n\t        adj_mat[u][v] = adj_mat[v][u] = 1;\n\t    }\n};\n\nint find_min_key(const vector<int>& arr, int V, const vector<unsigned char>& mstset)\n{\n    int min_key = INT_MAX;\n    for(int i = 0; i < V; i++)\n    {\n        if(arr[i] < min_key && mstset[i] == 0){\n            min_key = arr[i];\n        }\n    }\n    if(min_key == INT_MAX)\n        return -1;\n    for(int i = 0; i < V; i++)\n    {\n        if(arr[i] == min_key && mstset[i] == 0){\n            return i;\n        }\n    }\n    return -1;\n}\n\nint Prim_ST(const graph& G, const vector<pair<int,int>>& include_edges, const vector<pair<int,int>>& exclude_edges)\n{\n    int V = G.Vertex;\n\t           \n    vector<vector<int>> new_mat = G.adj_mat;\n    \n    int u1,v1;\n    for(vector<pair<int, int>>::const_iterator it=exclude_edges.begin(); it!=exclude_edges.end();it++)\n    {\n        u1=(*it).first;\n        v1=(*it).second;\n        new_mat[u1][v1]=new_mat[v1][u1]=INT_MIN;\n    }\n    \n    int parent[V];\n    vector<int> key(V);\n    vector<unsigned char> mstset(V, 0);\n    for(int i=0;i<V;i++)\n    {\n        key[i]=INT_MAX;\n        parent[i]=nVertices;\n    }\n    \n    int root;\n    root= 0;\n    parent[root]=-1;\n    \n    int vertex_must_include[V];\n    map<int, int> parent_included_vertex;\n    \n    for(int m=0;m<V;m++)\n        vertex_must_include[m]=false;\n    if(!include_edges.empty())\n    {\n        for(vector<pair<int, int>>::const_iterator it=include_edges.begin(); it!=include_edges.end();it++)\n        {\n            u1=(*it).first;\n            v1=(*it).second;\n            vertex_must_include[u1]=vertex_must_include[v1]=true;\n            parent_included_vertex[v1]=u1;\n            parent_included_vertex[u1]=100;\n        }\n    }\n    \n    key[root]=0;\n    parent[root]=-1;\n    for(int c=0;c<V;c++)\n    {\n        int u=find_min_key(key, V, mstset);\n        if(u==-1) //desconectado\n        {\n            return -1;\n        }\n        mstset[u]=1;\n        no_of_vert++;\n        for(int v=0;v<V;v++)\n        {\n            if(new_mat[u][v]>0 && mstset[v]==0 && new_mat[u][v]< key[v])\n            {\n                \n                if(vertex_must_include[v] && parent_included_vertex[v]!=100 && parent_included_vertex[v]!=u)\n                {\n                    int x=parent_included_vertex[v];\n                    if(parent[x]!=nVertices)\n                        continue;\n                }\n                parent[v]=u;\n                key[v]=new_mat[u][v];\n            }\n        }\n    }\n    \n    int tot_cost=0;\n    for(int i=1;i<V;i++){\n        int x=parent[i];\n        tot_cost+=new_mat[x][i];\n        current_span.push_back(make_pair(x, i));\n    }\n    return tot_cost;\n}\n\nvoid exibirVetor(const vector<int>& l)\n{\n    for(auto i: l)\n    {\n    \tif(i == l.back())\n    \t\tcout<<i;\n    \telse\n        \tcout<<i<<\"-\";\n    }\n    cout<<endl;\n}\n\nvoid build_tree_csr(int vertex_count, const vector<pair<int, int>>& edges,\n                    vector<int>& offsets, vector<int>& neighbors)\n{\n    offsets.assign(vertex_count + 1, 0);\n    for(vector<pair<int, int>>::const_iterator it = edges.begin(); it != edges.end(); ++it)\n    {\n        ++offsets[it->first + 1];\n        ++offsets[it->second + 1];\n    }\n    for(int i = 0; i < vertex_count; ++i)\n        offsets[i + 1] += offsets[i];\n\n    neighbors.resize(offsets[vertex_count]);\n    vector<int> next(offsets.begin(), offsets.end() - 1);\n    for(vector<pair<int, int>>::const_iterator it = edges.begin(); it != edges.end(); ++it)\n    {\n        neighbors[next[it->first]++] = it->second;\n        neighbors[next[it->second]++] = it->first;\n    }\n}\n\nbool deep(int vertice, vector<int>& hist,\n          const vector<int>& offsets, const vector<int>& neighbors,\n          vector<unsigned char>& visited, vector<int>& color_frequency,\n          int& distinct_colors)\n{\n    visited[vertice] = 1;\n    hist.push_back(vertice);\n    int color = vertex_color_ids[vertice];\n    if(color_frequency[color]++ == 0)\n        ++distinct_colors;\n\n    bool fim = true;\n    for(int edge = offsets[vertice]; edge < offsets[vertice + 1]; ++edge)\n    {\n        int neighbor = neighbors[edge];\n        if(!visited[neighbor])\n        {\n            fim = false;\n            if(deep(neighbor, hist, offsets, neighbors, visited,\n                    color_frequency, distinct_colors))\n                return true;\n        }\n    }\n\n    if(fim)\n    {\n        if(distinct_colors == nCores){\n            exibirVetor(hist);\n            cout<<distinct_colors;\n            return true;\n        }\n        else if(distinct_colors > contCor){\n            contCor = distinct_colors;\n            caminho = hist;\n        }\n    }\n\n    if(--color_frequency[color] == 0)\n        --distinct_colors;\n    visited[vertice] = 0;\n    hist.pop_back();\n    return false;\n}\n\nbool caminhoTropi(const graph& G){\n    int vertex_count = G.Vertex;\n    vector<int> offsets;\n    vector<int> neighbors;\n    build_tree_csr(vertex_count, arvoreGeradora, offsets, neighbors);\n    vector<unsigned char> visited(vertex_count, 0);\n    vector<int> color_frequency(compact_color_count, 0);\n\n\tfor (int i = 0; i < vertex_count; i++)\n    {\n\t\tvector<int> historico;\n\t\thistorico.push_back(i);\n        visited[i] = 1;\n        int root_color = vertex_color_ids[i];\n        if(color_frequency[root_color]++ == 0)\n            ++contCor;\n        int distinct_colors = contCor;\n\t    \n\t\tfor(int edge = offsets[i]; edge < offsets[i + 1]; ++edge){\n            int neighbor = neighbors[edge];\n            if(!visited[neighbor]){\n\t\t\t    if(deep(neighbor, historico, offsets, neighbors, visited,\n                        color_frequency, distinct_colors)){\n\t\t\t\t    return true;\n\t\t\t    }\n            }\n\t\t}\n\n        if(--color_frequency[root_color] == 0)\n            --distinct_colors;\n        contCor = distinct_colors;\n        visited[i] = 0;\n\t\thistorico.pop_back();\n\t}\n\treturn false;\n}\n\nbool create_partitions(const graph& G)\n{\n    while(true)\n    {\n    \tpart P;\n        vector<part>::iterator iter;\n        for(vector<part>::iterator it=partitions.begin();it!=partitions.end();it++)\n        {\n            iter=it;\n        }\n        P.spanning=(*iter).spanning;\n        P.exc_ed=(*iter).exc_ed;\n        P.inc_ed=(*iter).inc_ed;\n        partitions.erase(iter);\n        \n        vector<pair<int, int>> stree = P.spanning;\n        vector<pair<int, int>>::iterator it1;\n        vector<pair<int, int>>::iterator it2;\n        \n        arvoreGeradora = stree;\n        \n        if(caminhoTropi(G)){\n\t\t\treturn true;\n\t\t}\n        \n        vector<pair<int, int>> included_edges;\n        vector<pair<int, int>> excluded_edges;\n        included_edges=P.inc_ed;\n        pair<int, int> ex_edge;\n        \n        int j;\n        for(j = 0; j < stree.size(); j++)\n        {\n            if(included_edges.empty())\n                break;\n            if(stree[j].first!=included_edges[j].first && stree[j].second!=included_edges[j].second)\n            {\n                break;\n            }\n        }\n        int cost;\n        it2= stree.begin()+ j;\n        int u1,v1;\n        for(it1=it2; it1!=stree.end(); it1++)\n        {\n            part new_p;\n            u1=(*it1).first;\n            v1=(*it1).second;\n            ex_edge.first=u1;\n            ex_edge.second=v1;\n            excluded_edges=P.exc_ed;\n            excluded_edges.push_back(ex_edge);\n            current_span.clear();\n            cost = Prim_ST(G, included_edges, excluded_edges);\n            if(cost > 0)\n            {\n                new_p.spanning=current_span;\n                new_p.inc_ed=included_edges;\n                new_p.exc_ed=excluded_edges;\n                partitions.push_back(new_p);\n            }\n            included_edges.push_back(ex_edge);\n        }\n        \n        if(partitions.empty()){\n            return false;\n        }\n    }\n}\n\nint main() {\n    scanf(\"%i %i\", &nVertices, &nCores);\n    \n    graph G {nVertices};\n    \n    for\t(int i = 0; i < nVertices; i++){\n\t\tint cor;\n\t\tscanf(\"%i\", &cor);\n\t\tG.cores[i] = cor;\n\t}\n\n    vector<int> color_lookup(nCores, -1);\n    vertex_color_ids.resize(nVertices);\n    compact_color_count = 0;\n    for(int i = 0; i < nVertices; ++i){\n        int color = G.cores[i];\n        if(color_lookup[color] == -1)\n            color_lookup[color] = compact_color_count++;\n        vertex_color_ids[i] = color_lookup[color];\n    }\n    \n    scanf(\"%i\", &nArestas);\n    \n    for\t(int i = 0; i < nArestas; i++){\n    \tint u1, v1;\n\t\tscanf(\"%i %i\", &u1, &v1);\n        G.add_edge(u1, v1);\n\t}\n\t\n\tvector<pair<int, int>> incl;\n    vector<pair<int, int>> excl;\n    incl.clear();\n    excl.clear();\n    Prim_ST(G, incl, excl);\n    part p;\n    incl.clear();\n    excl.clear();\n    p.exc_ed=excl;\n    p.inc_ed=incl;\n    p.spanning=current_span;\n    partitions.push_back(p);\n    \n\tif(!create_partitions(G)){\n\t\texibirVetor(caminho);\n\t\tcout<<contCor<<endl;\n\t}\n\t\n    return 0;\n}\n","path":"src/tropical.cpp"}],"hypothesis":"Combining the selected parent’s Prim and reference/path-stack changes with CSR tree traversal and incremental compact-color counts may cut repeated edge-list scans and path color rescans. The baseline is already faster than each measured archived candidate, so this is a narrowly targeted full-program integration hypothesis, not an assumed speedup; the controller should compare the complete binary.","notes":"Retained only the declared e4ac65068e104b68 and 84fe6629befe48c3 source ideas. CSR neighbor insertion follows spanning-edge order to preserve traversal order. Full-program correctness and performance remain for controller evaluation.","sources_kept":["e4ac65068e104b68","84fe6629befe48c3"],"transformations":["Build contiguous CSR adjacency once per generated spanning tree, preserving each vertex's existing edge-iteration order.","Use shared path and visited buffers with backtracking for recursive tree search, replacing repeated spanning-edge scans.","Precompute compact vertex color IDs and maintain path-local color frequencies and the distinct-color count incrementally.","Retain the parent's cycle-check removal, const-reference parameters, byte membership flags, minimum-index tie behavior, and shared path stack."]}